<title>UK: Denmark sets C$100 million Eurobond due Dec 2002.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets C$100 million Eurobond due Dec 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DENMARK, KINGDOM OF</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     SIX	 MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.81    PAY DATE   S24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.21    SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
